/www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%A4%A9%E7%BA%BF%E5%88%86%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F"><rdfs:label>天线分系统</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8D%AB%E6%98%9F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F" /><rdfs:comment>星载天线分系统（通信/测控/数传天线）</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%A4%A9%E7%BA%BF"><rdfs:label>天线</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%A4%A9%E7%BA%BF%E5%88%86%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F" /><rdfs:comment>相控阵/反射面/赋形波束天线单元</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E6%95%B0%E4%BC%A0%E5%88%86%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F"><rdfs:label>数传分系统</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8D%AB%E6%98%9F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F" /><rdfs:comment>星地数传分系统：载荷数据下传</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E6%B5%8B%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%86%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F"><rdfs:label>测控分系统</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8D%AB%E6%98%9F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F" /><rdfs:comment>TT&amp;C：测距/遥测/遥控</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E5%88%86%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F"><rdfs:label>电源分系统</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8D%AB%E6%98%9F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F" /><rdfs:comment>太阳能电池阵+蓄电池，母线功率输出</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%A7%BF%E8%BD%A8%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%86%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F"><rdfs:label>姿轨控分系统</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8D%AB%E6%98%9F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F" /><rdfs:comment>AOCS：姿态确定与控制/轨道保持</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7"><rdfs:label>星座</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>多星星座构型：轨道面/相位/覆盖几何</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E6%98%9F%E5%9C%B0%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF"><rdfs:label>星地链路</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>馈电链路+用户链路：频率计划/极化/链路预算</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%9C%B0%E9%9D%A2%E6%AE%B5"><rdfs:label>地面段</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>卫星通信地面段总体</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%9C%B0%E9%9D%A2%E7%AB%99"><rdfs:label>地面站</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%9C%B0%E9%9D%A2%E6%AE%B5" /><rdfs:comment>关口站/信关站：射频前端+基带+网管</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E6%B5%8B%E6%8E%A7%E7%AB%99"><rdfs:label>测控站</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%9C%B0%E9%9D%A2%E6%AE%B5" /><rdfs:comment>地面测控站：测距/上行遥控/下行遥测</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%BB%88%E7%AB%AF"><rdfs:label>用户终端</rdfs:label><rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%9C%B0%E9%9D%A2%E6%AE%B5" /><rdfs:comment>动中通/静中通/便携终端</rdfs:comment></owl:Class><owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#EIRP"><rdfs:label>EIRP</rdfs:label><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E8%BD%AC%E5%8F%91%E5%99%A8" /><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E8%BD%BD%E8%8D%B7%E5%88%86%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F" /><rdfs:range rdf:resource="xsd:string" /><rdfs:comment>等效全向辐射功率（dBW）；转发器/载荷核心指标 ｜ 适用类</rdfs:comment></owl:DatatypeProperty><owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF%E4%BD%99%E9%87%8F"><rdfs:label>链路余量</rdfs:label><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E6%98%9F%E5%9C%B0%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF" /><rdfs:range rdf:resource="xsd:string" /><rdfs:comment>链路预算余量（dB），≥3dB 为工程惯例 ｜ 适用类</rdfs:comment></owl:DatatypeProperty><owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%B8%A6%E5%AE%BD"><rdfs:label>通信带宽</rdfs:label><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E8%BD%AC%E5%8F%91%E5%99%A8" /><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E6%98%9F%E5%9C%B0%E9%93%BE%E8%B7%AF" /><rdfs:range rdf:resource="xsd:string" /><rdfs:comment>转发器/信道带宽（MHz）｜ 适用类</rdfs:comment></owl:DatatypeProperty><owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4"><rdfs:label>覆盖范围</rdfs:label><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7" /><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%A4%A9%E7%BA%BF" /><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8D%AB%E6%98%9F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F" /><rdfs:range rdf:resource="xsd:string" /><rdfs:comment>波束覆盖区（半径 km / 覆盖百分比）｜ 适用类</rdfs:comment></owl:DatatypeProperty><owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E8%BD%A8%E9%81%93%E9%AB%98%E5%BA%A6"><rdfs:label>轨道高度</rdfs:label><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7" /><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%A1%E5%8D%AB%E6%98%9F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F" /><rdfs:range rdf:resource="xsd:string" /><rdfs:comment>轨道高度（km），如 LEO 500-1200 / GEO 35786 ｜ 适用类</rdfs:comment></owl:DatatypeProperty><owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%8A%9F%E7%8E%87"><rdfs:label>输出功率</rdfs:label><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E7%94%B5%E6%BA%90%E5%88%86%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F" /><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#%E5%8A%9F%E7%8E%87%E6%94%BE%E5%A4%A7%E5%99%A8" /><rdfs:range rdf:resource="xsd:string" /><rdfs:comment>电源/功放输出功率（W 或 kW）｜ 适用类</rdfs:comment></owl:DatatypeProperty><owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.xingwang.mbse/ontology#G/T%E5%80%BC"><rdfs:label>G/T值</rdfs:label><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.